      "id": "32c5241fcc564cbe12fdc9ef1f9e4906e2af5dffb7574c53a532f944eff287ae",
      "title": "Surprise, surprise: President Trump suggests the midterms were rigged",
      "url": "https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/7765656/2026/11/09/college-football-playoff-24-teams-espn-expansion",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-16T18:39:59.178Z",
